"""Easy-Print frontend installer, version 2 (new design, wired to your real backend).

HOW TO USE
  1. Save this file in your project folder: the folder that CONTAINS the "backend" folder.
  2. Run:   python update_frontend_v2.py
  3. Your current "frontend" folder is MOVED to _backup_before_update (nothing is deleted),
     the new one is written, and you are offered "npm install".

Then, in two terminals:
  backend:   cd backend  ->  python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
  frontend:  cd frontend ->  npm run dev      (http://localhost:5173)

Pages: /login (students and admin)   /app (student)   /admin (admin)   /kiosk (print station)
Your "backend" folder and data are never touched.
"""
